      <title>OPT Projected Structured-Light 3D Cameras</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-structured-light-cameras/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-structured-light-cameras/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The projected structured-light series targets high-precision one-shot reconstruction without a motion platform. It is positioned for dimensional measurement, positioning, bin picking, semiconductor, 3C, lithium battery, and automotive component inspection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
