&lt;em&gt;Pixel-aligned 2D and 3D output for inspection and measurement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;applications&#34;&gt;Applications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typical applications include toothbrush or workpiece bin picking, headset and sidewall dispensing guidance, semiconductor pin inspection, sealing nail weld inspection, smartphone middle-frame inspection, and high-precision surface bump or dent detection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















